msgid "The second command reads the `bitstrings_stepNN.txt` files written by the first, without submitting hardware jobs. Its `per-step` mode diagonalizes each file separately; it does not combine all files into one pooled subspace. `per-step` is the default with `--bitstrings-dir`, and `--mode pooled` is rejected there, because pooled mode runs the full circuit ensemble. Saved samples, including those from a hardware run, can therefore only be reprocessed per step.\n"
msgstr "Perintah kedua membaca file `bitstrings_stepNN.txt` yang ditulis oleh perintah pertama, tanpa mengirim job hardware. Mode `per-step`-nya mendiagonalisasi tiap file secara terpisah; ia tidak menggabungkan semua file menjadi satu subruang pooled. `per-step` adalah default untuk `--bitstrings-dir`, dan `--mode pooled` ditolak di sana, karena mode pooled menjalankan seluruh ensemble circuit. Jadi sampel yang tersimpan, termasuk dari eksekusi hardware, hanya bisa diproses ulang per langkah.\n"

